		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>70-foot-long astral whale embedded with hundreds of eyes. Sentient, curious. Often enslaved or allied with, used to carry cargo or passengers.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 51, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +7 (4d6), <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Gulp</strong>. Gulp down all creatures within near, DEX 15+ or target is swallowed. Total darkness inside, 2d10 damage per round. Regurgitates all swallowed if dealt at least 20 damage to the inside of its gullet in one round.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
